      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Privacy, chiefly. My grandmother called distance a duty: a house must remain above daily bargaining. I suspect she also disliked the noise. Both explanations became tradition.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "return",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "farewell",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "topic-2": {
      "Id": "topic-2",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The staff, of course. You mean the people below. Yes, I hear the contradiction. I am still deciding what acknowledging it requires of me.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "return",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "farewell",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "supply-offer": {
      "Id": "supply-offer",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "I asked why the treatment table was stocked for household guests but not for the people carrying their luggage. Apparently asking was easier than changing the order. Bring me four Kolto Injections and two Medi Syringes. Medical Piles in Dantooine's Abandoned Warehouse contain both and need no Scavenging perk to search. Trade is welcome too; take care in that warehouse. I can pay 1,200 credits from my own allowance.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "supply-accept",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-can-accept-quest",
              "Arguments": [
                "eshan_service_meds"
              ],
              "IsNegated": false
            },
            {
              "Key": "condition-has-quest",
              "Arguments": [
                "eshan_service_meds"
              ],
              "IsNegated": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "return",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "farewell",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "supply-accepted": {
      "Id": "supply-accepted",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Bring the supplies to me here in Highcrest. I will see that the treatment table opens through the service entrance as well.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "return",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "farewell",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
